# Files never to upload to a deployment.
#
# The important line is the question bank. It is gitignored, so a deployment
# built from the GitHub repo can never contain it — but the Vercel CLI uploads
# from the LOCAL folder, where the file does exist. This is the second lock on
# that door, so `vercel` run by hand cannot publish real interview material.
public/questions.seed.json

node_modules/
dist/
recordings-export/
*.local
.DS_Store
